---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Resume - Samson Kirigua" description="Samson Kirigua's professional experience in product design." nav="resume">
<!-- Page Header -->
<section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <h1>Resume</h1>
            <p class="resume-intro">8 years designing mobile-first products for marketplaces, fintech, clean energy, logistics and growth platforms in African markets, after 5 years in visual design.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Resume Content -->
<section class="about-content">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <!-- Experience Section -->
            <div class="resume-section">
                <h2>Experience</h2>

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-header">
                        <h3 class="experience-title">Senior Product Design Consultant</h3>
                        <span class="experience-date">May 2025 to Nov 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="experience-company">African Management Institute (AMI) · Learning products for African businesses</p>
                    <p class="experience-description">Embedded in the product team with a brief to raise the standard of UX across AMI. On CapPlus, made each stage of the diagnostic funnel visible, and conversion to a completed diagnostic rose from about 36% to around 50%. Also led research and design for D2E, an AI growth companion for small business owners, and designed offline sync for low connectivity in Ghana.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-header">
                        <h3 class="experience-title">Senior Product Design Consultant (contract)</h3>
                        <span class="experience-date">Jul 2025 to Jan 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="experience-company">Jumba · Construction materials marketplace</p>
                    <p class="experience-description">Traced a 90% seller drop-off in onboarding and moved the team's success measure from sign-ups to first sale. Replaced a 40 to 60 field listing form with a search-first flow built on the existing catalogue.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-header">
                        <h3 class="experience-title">Product Design Lead</h3>
                        <span class="experience-date">Dec 2023 to Jan 2025</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="experience-company">KOKO Networks · Clean energy</p>
                    <p class="experience-description">Managed three designers. Led design of an inventory tool that replaced the spreadsheets each warehouse and distribution team kept with one shared view of stock. Redesigned the Android stock take app used across 1,500+ agent shops, built for low-end devices and offline counts, so field staff could see expected stock against what they scanned while still in the shop.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-header">
                        <h3 class="experience-title">Product Designer to Product Design Lead</h3>
                        <span class="experience-date">Jul 2019 to Aug 2023</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="experience-company">Sendy · Logistics and e-commerce fulfilment</p>
                    <p class="experience-description">Joined as a Product Designer and was promoted to Senior Product Designer, then Product Design Lead, managing three designers. Built Sendy's design system from scratch for all its apps. Designed Pay by Bank Transfer for Nigerian merchants and a KYC platform used in Kenya, Uganda, Nigeria and Côte d'Ivoire.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Skills Section -->
            <div class="resume-section">
                <h2>Skills & expertise</h2>
                <p class="skills-list">UX research · Product discovery · Mobile and Android design · Payments · Internal tools · Design systems · Funnel analysis · Usability testing · Prototyping · Design leadership and mentoring</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Tools Section -->
            <div class="resume-section">
                <h2>Tools</h2>
                <p class="skills-list">Figma · Figma Make · Miro · Claude Code · Webflow · Google Sheets</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Testimonials -->
<section class="testimonials-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>What people say</h2>
        <div class="testimonials-grid">
            <div class="testimonial-card">
                <p class="testimonial-quote">"I saw him grow from a visual designer to a product designer, then to a senior product designer, and finally to my manager as the Product Design Lead."</p>
                <div class="testimonial-attribution">
                    <img class="testimonial-avatar" src="/images/denis-gachoki.jpg" alt="Denis Gachoki" width="40" height="40">
                    <div>
                        <p class="testimonial-name">Denis Gachoki</p>
                        <p class="testimonial-role">Product Designer</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-card">
                <p class="testimonial-quote">"His ability to communicate design decisions clearly and effectively has been crucial in driving project success."</p>
                <div class="testimonial-attribution">
                    <img class="testimonial-avatar" src="/images/supreet-kumar.jpg" alt="Supreet Kumar" width="40" height="40">
                    <div>
                        <p class="testimonial-name">Supreet Kumar</p>
                        <p class="testimonial-role">Senior Design Manager, IBM</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Contact -->
<section class="home-contact">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Let's connect</h2>
        <p>Open to senior and lead product design roles, including remote.</p>
        <a class="contact-email" data-user="hello" data-domain="samsonkirigua.com"></a>
        <div class="contact-links">
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/samsonkirigua/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

    <script>
        import '../scripts/email';
    </script>
</BaseLayout>
